- Recomendações de Ações de Marketing

Ofertas sazonais e segmentadas

Comunicação personalizada

Incentivos geográficos

Gamificação e engajamento

Monitoramento e otimização

- Limitações


A apresentação mostra como relatórios estratégicos e ações direcionadas podem aumentar a conversão de usuários casuais em assinantes anuais, 
além de recomendar o uso de modelos preditivos e dashboards em tempo real para otimizar decisões.

(EN - English)

# Presentation for Stakeholders
This PDF document brings together the main results and recommendations of the marketing project based on data from Motivate International Inc.

Topics covered:

- Marketing Objective

- Dataset

- Executive Summary

Main Insights

Key Recommendation

Next Steps

- Methodology

Data cleaning and preprocessing

Key variables analyzed

Tools used

- Analysis

Usage patterns: Casuals x Members

Seasonal and hourly behavior

Frequency by day of the week

Trip profile (duration × distance)

Usage zones

- Marketing Action Recommendations

Seasonal and segmented offers

Personalized communication

Geographic incentives

Gamification and engagement

Monitoring and optimization

- Limitations

The presentation shows how strategic reports and targeted actions can increase the conversion of casual users into annual subscribers,
as well as recommending the use of predictive models and real-time dashboards to optimize decisions.
